TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_9AF2_A152';
<p>9af2_a152</p> <h4>Two-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a two-point test cross examines two (2) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard two-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for both genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for both genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for two genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #006b73;">Gene T</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #006b73;"><i>tipsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #006b73;">Gene T</span> moves in an erratic path, suggesting a lack of coordination, as if intoxicated.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #8e387b;">Gene X</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #8e387b;"><i>xanthic</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8e387b;">Gene X</span> has a fluorescent bright yellow coloring.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="2" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">tipsy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f3f9; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f3; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">435</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f3f9; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8e387b;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">284</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006b73;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f3; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">265</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006b73;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8e387b;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">516</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="3" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,500</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, <strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_9AF2_A152
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(265 + 284)</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = <sup>549</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = 0.3660 = <strong>36.60 cM</strong>
LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(265 + 435)</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = <sup>700</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = 0.4667 = <strong>46.67 cM</strong>
LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(284 + 435)</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = <sup>719</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = 0.4793 = <strong>47.93 cM</strong>
LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(435 + 516)</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = <sup>951</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = 0.6340 = <strong>63.40 cM</strong>
LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_5';
<sup>265</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = <sup>265</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = 0.1767 = <strong>17.67 cM</strong>
LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_6';
<sup>516</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = <sup>516</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = 0.3440 = <strong>34.40 cM</strong>
LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(265 + 284)</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = <sup>549</sup>/<sub>1,500</sub> = 0.3660 = <strong>36.60 cM</strong>
LITERAL_9AF2_A152_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
